OL,3,GNEWSANew youth classes aim to tackle
OL,4,Aanti-social behaviour
OL,5,
OL,6,FFree boxing, dance and drama classes
OL,7,Fare being introduced in part of
OL,8,FLiverpool in a bid to tackle
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FThe initiative comes as Garston is
OL,12,Fplaced under a 72-hour dispersal zone,
OL,13,Fthe longest ever imposed by Merseyside
OL,14,FPolice using new powers granted by the
OL,15,Fgovernment.
OL,17,FIn recent years, the south Liverpool
OL,18,Fdistrict has been plagued by vandalism
OL,19,Fand criminal damage on so-called
OL,20,FMischief Night, the evening before
OL,21,FHalloween.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
